They are protected by copyright and no license to use them is granted.

Copying this code is prohibited under copyright. Without the author's written permission, you
may not:

- copy, reproduce, modify, distribute or publish the code, in whole or in part;
- reproduce or adapt the site's design, visual style or animations, including the dotted
  background grid, in other projects;
- use this repository or the site to train artificial intelligence models, or use AI tools or
